      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Department of City Planning and the Housing and Development Administration, working with the Clinton Planning Council, are preparing plans to build a substantial number of low-, moderate- and middle-income housing units in the area around Dewitt Clinton Park, with a view towards redeveloping this potentially attractive district as a residential community;",
